{"title": "Hide Armour +2", "pageid": 6781, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hide_Armour_+2", "categories": ["Medium Armour", "Rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Icon.png/300px-Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/6/6f/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Hide Armour +2 image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Icon.png/300px-Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6f/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Hide Armour +2</span></a></b> is a rare <a href=\"/wiki/Armour#Medium_Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Medium Armour</a> that grants a +1 bonus to Dexterity <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Checks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Checks\">Ability Checks</a>, as well as <a href=\"/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>This hide armour, soft to the touch but hard as a zaratan's hide, is stitched together of narrow panels allowing for the wearer's ease of movement and comfort.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-ac-value\" style=\"grid-template-columns: 42px; 1fr\">\n<div><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/60px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/80px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"ac-value\" aria-label=\"Armour class: 14\">14</div>\n<div class=\"ac-value-comment\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> + <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity#Dexterity_Modifier_Chart\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity modifier</a> <i>(max +2)</i></div>\n</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" title=\"Medium Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/38px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/50px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Medium Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium Armour\">Medium Armour</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Required Proficiency: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" title=\"Medium Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/38px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/50px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Medium Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium Armour\">Medium Armour</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/25px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/38px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Dippable Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/25px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Enchantment: <b>+ 2</b></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 5.4 kg (10.8 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 5.4 kg (10.8 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 310 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  310  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Hide_2</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_Hide_2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_Hide_2\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">fd4ab5b0-67e6-4a8b-8745-2003f2f5ada3</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fd4ab5b0-67e6-4a8b-8745-2003f2f5ada3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fd4ab5b0-67e6-4a8b-8745-2003f2f5ada3\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Hide_Body_2</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_Hide_Body_2+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_Hide_Body_2+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Balance\" title=\"Balance\">Balance</a></dt><dd>Gain a +1 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">Saving throws</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/23px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/34px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/45px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/23px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Ability checks</a></dd></dl><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Ambusher_(%2B1)\" title=\"Ambusher (+1)\">Ambusher</a></dt><dd>Gain a +1 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Initiative_Icon.png/25px-Initiative_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Initiative_Icon.png/38px-Initiative_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Initiative_Icon.png/50px-Initiative_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Initiative Rolls\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Initiative_Icon.png/25px-Initiative_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Initiative_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative Rolls</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by traders using the <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Armour_Trader_Table#Traders\" title=\"Magic Armour Trader Table\">levelled magic armour table</a> if the player character is level 5 or above</li>\n<li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grat\" title=\"Grat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Portrait_Grat.png/25px-Portrait_Grat.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Portrait_Grat.png/38px-Portrait_Grat.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Portrait_Grat.png/50px-Portrait_Grat.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Portrait_Grat.png/25px-Portrait_Grat.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Portrait_Grat.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grat\" title=\"Grat\">Grat</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Camp\" title=\"Goblin Camp\">Goblin Camp</a> regardless of level</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Aside from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Vigilance\" title=\"Elixir of Vigilance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/ELX_Elixir_of_Vigilance_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Vigilance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/ELX_Elixir_of_Vigilance_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Vigilance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/ELX_Elixir_of_Vigilance_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Vigilance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/ELX_Elixir_of_Vigilance_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Vigilance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/ELX_Elixir_of_Vigilance_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Vigilance\" title=\"Elixir of Vigilance\">Elixirs of Vigilance</a>, this is one of the earlier items available in quantity that can boost initiative for those with <a href=\"/wiki/Armour#List_of_medium_armour\" title=\"Armour\">medium armour</a> proficiency.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Balance:</i></p>\n<ul><li>The bonus to Dexterity ability checks from <b>Balance</b> does not appear on the character but is correctly added when rolled.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Models</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 100px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 98px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Hide_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 1 Front Human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Hide_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp/147px-Hide_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Hide_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp/220px-Hide_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/8d/Hide_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hide Armour +2 Human Front\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Hide_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp/147px-Hide_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"98\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Hide_Armour_%2B2_Human_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Body Type 1 Front <br><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 96.666666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" styl